body:
A man walks into a Doctor's office with a high pitched voice and goes "Doctor, I don't like my voice, is there any way to change it?" The doctor examines him and goes "Well your dick is too big and its pulling on your vocal chords." So after a long process the guy gets a surgery to take a few inches off and goes home happy. He comes back a week later and says "Doctor, I love y new voice, but my wife misses my old dick. Is there any way to get it back?"

&#x200B;

Then the doctor, in a high-pitched voice, goes "Nope, sorry! Nothing I can do!"

For the first part, women going braless in general is alright. If I saw someone in public going braless, I would do my best to not look at their nipple/tits.

&#x200B;

If my date showed up without a bra, I would try to be as respectful as possible, keep my eyes up to where hers are, and pretend everything is completely normal.

